MID_SE_Ism_Tia_A: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_A_001: Take this kind of strategy, for example. We could use\nit to hold a strong defensive line for a long time.
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_A_002: I'm just repeating something I've learned, but it's\ngood to keep these details in mind for future battles.
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_A_003: <NCA>"That's Great August's Formation, isn't it?"
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_A_004: <NCB>"Seems similar to the kingdom of Arago's tactics."
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_A_005: <ACA>You've...heard of my grandpa?
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_A_006: <ACA>Wow. I guess everyone knows Grandpa, even the\nPromised One.
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_A_007: <ACB>Yes! I learned it from my grandpa, the Great August.\nHe built the foundations of Arago's military tactics.
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_A_008: These days, Grandpa commands troops in the village,\nteaching strategy to folks who've never studied it.
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_A_009: But he hasn't been an official strategist for quite a\nwhile now.
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_A_010: <NCA>"Why is that?"
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_A_011: <NCB>"I've heard he was a wise and resourceful leader."
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_A_012: When I was little, Grandpa would devise brilliant\ntactics far away from the front lines.
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_A_013: We were a military family. My father was a knight,\nand Mom was a mage.
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_A_014: But then there was the day when both my parents\ntook part in a plan that Grandpa devised.
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_A_015: We got word from Grand Aragon that they'd both\nfallen in the line of duty.
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_A_016: Ah...
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_A_017: Grandpa blamed himself for their deaths. I didn't\nunderstand that when I was little.
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_A_018: But it's why he gave up his life as a tactician and\nmoved to Ribeira to escape those bonds.
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_A_019: Eventually he overcame his grief and took a stand\nfor the people around him.
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_A_020: People who had no idea how to react to the war at\ntheir doorsteps. I'm so proud of him for that.
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_A_021: And of course, I hold you in high esteem too,\nPromised One.
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_A_022: Giving orders to your allies fighting alongside you...\nWell, it isn't easy, is it?
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_A_023: I know what it's like to make difficult choices.
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_A_024: But you, you're carrying all our lives, the fate of the\nworld on your shoulders. How do you do it?
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_A_025: <NCA>"It's just something I have to do."
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_A_026: Promised One, if there's anything I can do to help\nyou, you just need to ask.
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_A_027: This is the reason I read all those books.
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_A_028: But now I have experience too. I've traveled through\nmany villages, and I've overseen many defenses.
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_A_029: I'll prove myself useful to you, I swear. You can\ncount on me.
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_S: <EDH>
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_S_001: Promised One?
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_S_002: Thank goodness! You're alright!
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_S_003: I keep thinking... If only I'd come up with a\nbetter plan.
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_S_004: Like, maybe there was a way that you wouldn't have\nto stay in the underworld.
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_S_005: <NCA>"You needn't fret about that anymore."
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_S_006: <NCB>"Don't cry."
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_S_007: <ACA>I know. Because you're here now.
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_S_008: <ACB>*sniffle* My heart's overwhelmed.
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_S_009: Truly, I'm overjoyed. The world is safe. And\nyou're alive.
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_S_010: It's finally over, isn't it? Our war is done.
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_S_011: <NCA>"I'm indebted to you."
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_S_012: That's not true. I didn't do anything.
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_S_013: I'm just a poor imitation of my grandpa. He's the\nmaster tactician.
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_S_014: <NCA>"I'm grateful for your grandfather too."
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_S_015: I'm glad to hear it. In fact, would you like to come\nvisit my home?
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_S_016: You know all about strategies and tactics. I bet you'd\nget along great with Grandpa!
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_S_017: <NCA>"I've been thinking a formal introduction is in order."
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_S_018: Really? I was half kidding. What does this all mean?\nUgh... You're overthinking it as usual, Tialla.
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_S_019: Ahem! Let's...just go.
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_S_020: <RSDS>Grandpa's probably going to pass out when I show up\nwith you.
MID_SE_Ism_Tia_S_021: We'll read and talk and talk and talk. We'll enjoy all\nthat peace has to offer.